## 2. API КОНТРАКТЫ

### 2.1. API Gateway → Сервисы

#### 2.1.1. Маршрутизация

| Метод | Путь | Целевой сервис |
|-------|------|----------------|
| GET | `/api/v3/forecast` | Astro Service |
| GET | `/api/v4/state` | Psychometry Service |
| GET | `/api/v4/achievements` | Psychometry Service |
| GET | `/api/v4/window` | Psychometry Service |
| GET | `/api/v4/recommendations` | Psychometry Service |
| POST | `/api/v4/feedback` | Psychometry Service |
| GET | `/api/v4/alignment/coherence` | Alignment Engine |
| POST | `/api/v4/tuner/*` | Final Tuner |

